/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1260 0 R
/E (Active Mechanism: Beets are rich in inorganic dietary nitrates \(NO3-\). Oral bacteria on your tongue reduce these nitrates into nitrites \(NO2-\), which the acidic stomach and blood vessels convert into nitric oxide \(NO\). Nitric oxide signals vascular smooth muscle to relax \(vasodilation\), expanding blood vessel diameter, improving oxygen delivery to working tissues, and systematically lowering blood pressure.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
